@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox

participant "Voime addon" as Addon
participant "Fcitx InputContext" as Ic
participant "Fcitx frontend" as Frontend
participant "目标应用" as App

Addon -> Addon : Final(segment_id, text)
Addon -> Addon : 复核目标存在且 hasFocus()

alt 目标有效
  Addon -> Ic : commitString(text)
  Ic -> Frontend : commit
  Frontend -> App : 插入 UTF-8 文本
else 目标失效
  Addon -> Addon : 不提交\n保留 daemon 历史
end

note over Frontend
  Wayland：text-input-v3 commit_string
  XWayland / X11：XIM_COMMIT
  commit filter 由 Fcitx 处理。
end note
@enduml
